{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21854","headline":"和乐天示杨琼 · 元稹","name":"和乐天示杨琼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我在江陵少年日，知有杨琼初唤出。\n腰身瘦小歌圆紧，依约年应十六七。\n去年十月过苏州，琼来拜问郎不识。\n青衫玉貌何处去，安得红旗遮头白。\n我语杨琼琼莫语，汝虽笑我我笑汝。\n汝今无复小腰身，不似江陵时好女。\n杨琼爲我歌送酒，尔忆江陵县中否。\n江陵王令骨爲灰，车来嫁作尚书妇。\n卢戡及第严涧在，其余死者十八九。\n我今贺尔亦自多，尔得老成余白首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}